# Resource System (Public Edition)

The ResourceSystem manages engine assets at runtime. This excerpt provides a high-level explanation suitable for public release.

## Responsibilities
- Load and cache required resources such as shaders and other GPU assets.
- Offer helper functions for retrieving compiled programs.
- Ensure resources are released during shutdown.

Implementation specifics, path conventions, and performance instrumentation are **[REDACTED]**. Refer to the secured vault for exact APIs and integration notes.
